## Case: ace-m2-g03-bounded5
id: "ace.m2.g03.bounded5"
tags: ["ace-m2", "generics", "spec-bound", "plan-963"]
links: ["PLAN-963"]

### Auto
path: "main.at"

~~~~auto
spec Summable { fn total() int }
type Score as Summable { val int
    fn total() int { return .val }
}
type Box<T has Summable> { inner T }
fn main() int {
    let b Box<Score> = Box { inner: Score { val: 5 } }
    let s Score = b.inner
    return s.total()
}
~~~~

